        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Apache</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Homeland</span><span class="info-stat-val">Apacheria: the mountains, valleys, canyons, deserts and southern Great Plains of what is now eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/arizona">Arizona</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-mexico">New Mexico</a>, West <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/texas">Texas</a>, southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/colorado">Colorado</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sonora">Sonora</a> and Chihuahua; today tribes and reservations in Arizona, New Mexico, Texas and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oklahoma">Oklahoma</a>, among them Fort Apache, San Carlos, Mescalero and Jicarilla, and communities in Sonora, Chihuahua, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/coahuila">Coahuila</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tamaulipas">Tamaulipas</a></span></div>
